++\todo{Mask sparsity varies $6\times$ across packs $\to$ DDP rank imbalance. Offline
++epoch precompute + kv\_block\_count quantile buckets; ranks draw from the same bucket.
++$1.45\times$ mean step speedup. Reuse docs/images/density_aware_*.png.}
